  <name>Emberfall / Stone Guardian / uproot and two-handed overhead throw</name>
  <desc>Original Krita 2D cutouts. Anatomical elbow flexion matches the idle hinge side through crouch, lift, overhead throw and follow-through. Crouch 16f, tear 29f, lift 53f, overhead 70-80f, release 90f, rest 114f. Mirrored hands and torso controls drive the existing game actor; preview flight is illustrative, runtime target is dynamic.</desc>
